# Important Files

## Configuration Files
- `package.json` - Project dependencies and scripts
- `vite.config.ts` - Vite configuration
- `tsconfig.json` - TypeScript configuration
- `jest.config.ts` - Jest test configuration
- `tailwind.config.js` - Tailwind CSS configuration
- `postcss.config.js` - PostCSS configuration
- `eslint.config.js` - ESLint configuration

## Source Files
- `src/main.tsx` - Application entry point
- `src/app/page.tsx` - Main page component
- `src/app/layout.tsx` - Root layout component
- `src/app/ui/ProductCard.tsx` - Product card component
- `src/app/ui/ProductList.tsx` - Product list component
- `src/app/ui/hooks/useInfiniteScroll.ts` - Infinite scroll hook
- `src/app/lib/data/products.ts` - Product data handling

## Test Files
- `src/app/ui/hooks/useInfiniteScroll.test.tsx` - Infinite scroll hook tests

Note: If new files are added to the project, they should be added to this list.
